      "text": "Prepare the CHERRY TOMATOES, goat cheese, and herbs. While the pasta is cooking, heat the oil and garlic in a small saucepan over moderately low heat. Remove as soon as garlic begins to turn color, and pour it over the cooked and drained pasta (fettucine). Add the remaining ingredients and toss."
